# Advisory style, close to ESP-IDF's own (docs/api-guides/style-guide): LLVM base,
# 4-space indent, 120 columns, no tabs. Enforced in CI only as a dry-run advisory
# (continue-on-error) until the codebase is reformatted on purpose.
---
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: '4'
ColumnLimit: '120'
UseTab: Never
ReflowComments: 'true'
PointerAlignment: Right
AlignAfterOpenBracket: Align
SortIncludes: false
IncludeBlocks: Preserve
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: None
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: false
BreakBeforeBraces: Attach
SpaceBeforeParens: ControlStatements
FixNamespaceComments: false

# C11
Standard: c++11